tal — never a storefront\npicker or any other store. If your account has multiple storefronts, each API\ntoken mints portal links for its own store.",[297,1437,1438,1439,1442],{},"Redirect the customer's browser to the returned ",[341,1440,1441],{},"url",". It expires after roughly\n15 minutes and can be consumed once, so create a fresh one per visit. The link\nis credential-bearing — do not cache or log it.",[309,1444,511],{"id":1445},"optional-attributes-3",[314,1447,1448,1458],{},[317,1449,1450],{},[320,1451,1452,1454,1456],{},[323,1453,325],{},[323,1455,328],{},[323,1457,331],{},[333,1459,1460],{},[320,1461,1462,1467,1471],{},[338,1463,1464],{},[341,1465,1466],{},"returnUrl",[338,1468,1469],{},[341,1470,348],{},[338,1472,1473],{},"Absolute HTTPS URL (max 2048 bytes) rendered as a return link in the portal. Vatly never fetches or auto-redirects to it.",[297,1475,1476,1477,1480],{},"The returned ",[341,1478,1479],{},"PortalSession"," has three properties:",[314,1482,1483,1493],{},[317,1484,1485],{},[320,1486,1487,1489,1491],{},[323,1488,325],{},[323,1490,328],{},[323,1492,331],{},[333,1494,1495,1508,1522],{},[320,1496,1497,1501,1505],{},[338,1498,1499],{},[341,1500,1441],{},[338,1502,1503],{},[341,1504,348],{},[338,1506,1507],{},"Single-use HTTPS URL to redirect the customer to.",[320,1509,1510,1515,1519],{},[338,1511,1512],{},[341,1513,1514],{},"expiresAt",[338,1516,1517],{},[341,1518,348],{},[338,1520,1521],{},"Expiry of the one-time entry link (ISO 8601).",[320,1523,1524,1528,1532],{},[338,1525,1526],{},[341,1527,1466],{},[338,1529,1530],{},[341,1531,399],{},[338,1533,1534,1535,373],{},"The validated return URL you supplied, or ",[341,1536,862],{},[552,1538,1540],{"className":554,"code":1539,"language":556,"meta":557,"style":557},"$session = $vatly->customers->createPortalSession('customer_abc123', [\n    'returnUrl' => 'https:\u002F\u002Fyourapp.com\u002Faccount\u002Fbilling',\n]);\n\n\u002F\u002F Redirect the customer's browser to the hosted portal.\nheader('